Z||000003||rockcrawl||06-18-2001||03:43 PM||||Suspension Restoration Parts Co. sells a complete package for the Fiero using Prothane and McQuay-Norris. <P>84-87 only Front & rear control arm bushings, front sway bar frame & endlinks, engine cradle mounts, engine strut torque(dogbone) bushings, poly tie rod end boots,  <BR>Front upper & lower ball joints, front outer tie rod ends, rear lower ball joints and rear outer tie rod ends. $340.00 <BR>You can also get the parts individually.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.suspension.com/fiero-prothane.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.suspension.com/fiero-prothane.htm</A> <P>||||reg||1
